@startuml
title Say something
actor "Dee" as dee
participant "Chat" as app
actor "Ada, Bob (have room:general open)" as room
actor "Eve (has room:kitchen open)" as other

dee -> app : add room:general /messages/- <text>
alt Dee is not in general
  app --> dee : you are not in this room
else
  note right of app : the app stamps author and at
  app --> dee : patch room:general add /messages/- (Dee, text, at)
  app -> room : patch room:general add /messages/- (Dee, text, at)
  note over dee : on the ledger: Undo takes it back, for everyone
end
note over other : nothing: room:kitchen did not change
@enduml
